{
  "_about": "The shape of local/buffer-channels.json, the only Buffer channels the engine may read. Every ID and name here is synthetic. The real file stays in the ignored local/ folder and names Full Time brand channels only: never a personal or other-product channel. organization_id is required, because Buffer's list_posts needs it. A null buffer_channel_id is a channel Buffer does not carry, which Krish posts by hand. The optional buffer_name is the channel name list_channels shows; when the session passes Buffer's own channel records, each ID must have the entry's service and that name. Reels and feed share one Instagram channel, so they share one ID; no other entries may.",
